# ============================================================================
# CULT-ULHU map file: eldritch_battlefield
#
# Wave 17 art pass: a dark eldritch battlefield in four zones —
# shattered_court (ruined courtyard), cavern_mouth (cave rocks),
# ashen_grove (dead forest), ember_shrine (torch-lit shrine).
# Wave 19 second dark-art pass: +48 atmospheric placements (arches, broken
# stairs, bones, coffins, mist banks, scorch, embers, dead bushes).
# Wave 35 forest/deep-ruins procgen pass: +28 placements (ash-thicket,
# hanging-moss, fungal-shelf, root-tangle in ashen_grove; ruined-column-b,
# fallen-lintel, flagstone-slab, broken-obelisk in shattered_court and at
# the cavern_mouth deep-ruins edge).
# 162 placements + 4 atmosphere records. All models CC0 (Kenney Graveyard/Nature, KayKit
# Dungeon Remastered/Halloween Bits) or in-house procgen. See
# assets/world/MANIFEST.md.
#
# FORMAT: see the format block at the top of ruined_city.map. Wave 38 adds
#   lod <model> hide=<m> [low=<m>]
# and optional per-placement culling hints:
#   place <model> <x> <y> <z> <rotYdeg> <scale> <zone> [cull=<m>] [nevercull]
# (hide past <m> meters / pin visible at any distance).
# ============================================================================

map eldritch_battlefield

zone shattered_court -60 0 -60 60 0 60 70
zone cavern_mouth 80 0 -60 200 0 60 65
zone ashen_grove -200 0 -60 -80 0 60 55
zone ember_shrine -60 0 80 60 0 200 75

# --- wave 32: atmosphere (lighting/mood data for the UE5 binding) ---
# shattered_court: open violet-black night, stars burning through the ruin-haze
atmosphere shattered_court fog=#0a0618,0.45 ambient=#241a3a,0.35 sky=#050214 stars=0.9
# cavern_mouth: the rock swallows the sky — near-black, choking fog, no stars
atmosphere cavern_mouth fog=#030208,0.85 ambient=#0d0a18,0.18 sky=#01010a stars=0.0
# ashen_grove: grey-violet ash-haze, dim drowned stars
atmosphere ashen_grove fog=#14101f,0.6 ambient=#1c1626,0.28 sky=#070512 stars=0.4
# ember_shrine: ember-light bleeds into the dark — warm fog, pulsing gloom
atmosphere ember_shrine fog=#170a08,0.55 ambient=#3a1a0e,0.45 sky=#0a0408 stars=0.5


# --- wave 38: LOD distances (hide = hide past this range in meters,
# low = switch to low-detail past this range; 0 = none) ---
# Tuned from measured GLB triangle counts: detail(<120) 150/60,
# props(<=450) 250/120, set pieces(<=900) 400/200, large 600/250,
# landmarks 900/300, ground fx 50-60, lit props 200-300.
# The engine binding consumes these (see unreal/Docs/SystemMapping.md).
